{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は祝日でしたので、\nゆっくり寝れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼伊藤ちゃんず／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てこの距離感。\nなんだよ！もっとくっつけよ！\nってツッコみたくなる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のブレザーはグレー組。\nねねのえくぼかわいい。\nねねはコンパクト。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n企画いろいろ考えてくださって\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーゆるいね！まりっ会！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベレー帽 FREAK'S STORE\nニット 45rpm\nティペット pas de calais\nスカート used\nブーツ Dr.Martens\nリュック COACE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどママのおさがりだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートは自分で買ったよー\n中途半端に長い。\nもさい度★★★★★\nばんざい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近帽子かぶりすぎでね！\n最近というかいっつもだ！\nかぶると落ち着くんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと髪の毛\nうねうねにならないかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーでも\n菊地亜希子さんの本読んでたら\n髪切りたくなってきた！\nでも切らない！！\nキープキープキープ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生のみなさんもテスト期間かな。\n一緒に頑張りましょう！\n絶賛テスト勉強中流行らせよう←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/8184648/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}